# Device-port mount plan. This file is intentionally not activated by OpenRC.
# USERDATA currently belongs to Android and provisioning it would be destructive.
# Activate only after an explicitly authorized installer/recovery operation has
# formatted USERDATA for Alpine EReader OS and validated rollback to stock.

# /dev/block/platform/13540000.dwmmc0/by-name/USERDATA /var/lib/ereader ext4 noatime,nosuid,nodev 0 2
